- `packages/engine/src/ontolearn_engine/semantic_turtle.py`，32824B，SHA256 `c4a943df443e5379ab38d00d0fc588a8097c68dd9ca60a4f1b1bd0da381a1534`。stdlib AST 逐项与自树 c05ddd 交接源相同；差异为格式，没有假定字节相同。
